Z||000000||olliver||04-13-2001||10:27 PM||||That's right boys and girls..i'm finally doing it.  My baby is an '86 GT 2.8L auto.  The engine is out and getting a racing rebuild with 220 hp (naturally aspirated).  I haven't been told yet what stall to get for my new t.c. (around 2800-3000).  Polyeurathane all around.  Everything that i can think of i'm going to do... hell you only get to do this once, so i better do it right!!!||||reg||1
