Z||000012||olliver||04-16-2001||10:45 PM||||Before anyone jumps down my throut.  That's a 454 not a 400.  And if anyone wants the address/phone # of their shop i can send it to you.  <P>I don't want to start a "pissing contest" here because building engines is not my specialty, fixing F-18's is.  And if he says he can get 240hp from a mpfi 2.8L and 270 from a carb'd 2.8L then i believe him.||||reg||1
